ERAgaze links at runtime against the Tobii Stream Engine library found in the
user's own Tobii installation; no Tobii software is included in or
redistributed with this project. Tobii and TD Snap are trademarks of their
respective owners; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Tobii.

Interoperability attribution: the gaze-bus message shape
({gazePoint:{x,y}, validity, timestamp} + GET /status) was adopted for
interoperability from Aivota AAC's gaze sidecar contract, with the developer's
knowledge from a July 2026 collaboration; the implementation is entirely
independent. Signal-processing draws on the published One-Euro filter
(Casiez, Roussel, Vogel 2012).
